        {
          "text": "Nayo ababa mu karerere k’imisozi miremire, uhereye i Libani ugashika i Misirefoti-Mayimu, ahaba Abanyesidoni hose, nzohabirukana jewe nyene imbere y’Abisirayeli. Ariko wewe urabe neza ko igihugu wakigaburiye Abisirayeli nk’iragi ryabo, kandi nk’uko nabikubwiye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
